  "question": {
    "text": "For photo-electric effect with incident photon wavelength <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi></math> , the stopping potential is <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></math> . Identify the correct variation(s) of <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></math> with <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi></math> and <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi></mrow></mfrac></math> ."
  },
